        <briefdescription>
<para>Provide a weight to bias towards choosing this strategy for a mutation. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The value of the weight is arbitrary, but a good default is &quot;the number of
distinct ways in which this strategy can mutate a unit&quot;. This can also be used to prefer strategies that shrink the overall size of the result when we start getting close to <computeroutput>MaxSize</computeroutput>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
